<title>SPAIN: Spain's one year bills yield rose to 5.315%.</title>
<headline>Spain's one year bills yield rose to 5.315%.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Wednesday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE Yield Pvs Price Pvs Bid Allocated 1-year</p>
<p>5.315   5.172   94.90  95.03    188.645  150.445</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
